### Finding 3 — No Input Validation on Query/Path Parameters (OWASP A03)

**Severity: 🟠 High**

The app currently has no query parameter handling, but the moment any route accepts user input (search, ID lookup, filters) there is no validation layer in place to prevent injection or unexpected types.

**Recommendation — install a validation middleware before adding any parameterised routes:**
```js
