### Finding 7 — No Request Body Parsing Limits (OWASP A04)

**Severity: 🟡 Medium**

There is no `express.json()` or body-size cap configured. When POST/PUT routes are added — and they will be — the app will either crash on malformed JSON or be vulnerable to multi-megabyte payload attacks.

**Recommendation — configure body parsing defensively from the start:**
```js
